Description: Python client library for the Ganeti Remote API (RAPI)
 A modern, modular, and type-annotated Python client for the Ganeti Remote API.
 .
 Features:
  * Synchronous and asynchronous client support
  * Fully type-annotated API for IDE autocompletion and static analysis
  * Modular architecture for extensibility
  * Minimal runtime dependencies (only httpx)